  <running_head>LIBER TERTIVS.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">Hispaniâ, ubi ille scripsit) <i>quasi Quan-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>ferens caput. Suspensum enim</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>&amp; strangulatum hæc examinat.</i> In</l>
    <l n="4">libris legum, quas Tribonianus</l>
    <l n="5">atque ejus adjuvæ collegerunt,</l>
    <l n="6">satis frequens hoc nomen: &amp;, ut</l>
    <l n="7">opinor, significatione novitiâ:</l>
    <l n="8">quia sublato Crucis supplicio,</l>
    <l n="9">quidni etiam Furca vetus? Itaque</l>
    <l n="10">ipsos Iurisconsultos usurpasse, non</l>
    <l n="11">habet fidem apud juris &amp; mo-</l>
    <l n="12">ris antiqui peritos. qui verè</l>
    <l n="13">nominant, substitutum id pro Cruce:</l>
    <l n="14">caussâ apertâ &amp; liquidâ, quia</l>
    <l n="15">Constantinus lege latâ sustulerat</l>
    <l n="16">Crucem. Ergo ipsi quoque, qui</l>
    <l n="17">leges collectum ibant in ævi il-</l>
    <l n="18">lius &amp; sequentis usum. Exem-</l>
    <l n="19">pla plura sunt, &amp; notata aliis:</l>
    <l n="20">quædam etiam ubi inconspectio.</l>
    <l n="21">ut in isto Calliistrati , de Pœ-</l>
    <l n="22">nis: <i>Famosos latrones furcâ figen-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>dos placuit.</i> Inconspectè, inquam</l>
    <l n="24">imò ineptè. Quid? ad Furcam</l>
    <l n="25">novam</l>
    <l n="26" type="foot" para="true">¹ Lib. xxix.</l>
  </main_text>
